[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-overview-1600x120.png[/img]
Venworks Customizable HUD is a set of five Starfield helmet HUDs. Pick the look you want. Each theme is its own download, and it draws through Venworks Canvas.

[size=3][b][u]Requirements[/u][/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/7097]Venworks - Core Utilities[/url] version 2.1.8 or newer.[/*]
[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/starfield/mods/18327]Venworks Canvas[/url] version 1.0.4 or newer.[/*]
[*]Install one HUD theme.[/*]
[/list]

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-features-1600x120.png[/img]
[list]
[*]Compass, threat warning, and a short row of status icons. Helpful effects sit on the top line. Harmful effects use the two lines under it.[/*]
[*]Health, oxygen, CO2, boost, carry weight, credits, local time, and level.[/*]
[*]Favorites, weapon, ammo, explosives, and powers on the equipment rail. Minimalist leaves this rail off.[/*]
[*]Where you are, the local clock, gravity, suit protection, and hazards.[/*]
[*]Your tracked mission, a radar of known contacts, and a scanner view when you scan.[/*]
[*]The game's own button prompt when you are ready to leave a vehicle.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][u]Themes[/u][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Venworks[/*]
[*]Trackers Alliance[/*]
[*]Freestar Collective[/*]
[*]Crimson Fleet[/*]
[*]Minimalist[/*]
[/list]

Minimalist is the smaller pale-blue layout, with no faction crest and no equipment rail. Please only enable one theme at a time.

[size=3][b][u]Which file to download[/u][/b][/size]

[b]Normal[/b] is the usual install. It is the theme plugin plus one archive.

[b]Fully Loose Files[/b] is for people who want to edit the pages and art. Install Normal or Fully Loose, not both.

[size=3][b][u]Make it yours on PC[/u][/b][/size]

You can recolor, move, resize, or hide panels with one small style file named [b]vwhud-overrides.css[/b]. Put that file in its own mod and load it after the HUD. Everyone else can leave the theme archived.

The [url=https://github.com/monster-cookie/venworks-honkcore-ta-ui/blob/master/docs/CUSTOMIZING_THEMES.md]customization guide[/url] shows the folder for each theme and a few examples.

To hide or remove the equipment rail, follow [url=https://github.com/monster-cookie/venworks-honkcore-ta-ui/blob/master/docs/REMOVING_EQUIPRAIL.md]Removing the equipment rail[/url].

[img]https://cdn.venworkscreations.com/NexusMods/description-divider-known-issues-1600x120.png[/img]
[list]
[*]This release is still in beta while more people try it.[/*]
[*]The radar shows contacts the game already knows about. It does not hunt for life on its own.[/*]
[*]Notes from large HUD mode, ultrawide screens, and consoles help a lot.[/*]
[*]Other HUD mods share the screen through Venworks Canvas.[/*]
[*]If you see [b]UNSUPPORTED CONSUMER PROTOCOL[/b], quit Starfield completely, update Canvas to 1.0.4 or newer, clear out any duplicate or leftover copy, and start the game again.[/*]
[/list]

